\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.1}{\ignorespaces Target multi-model detection system. The final decision is taken by voting among complementary experts over a multi-cycle observation window. This internship designs and validates Expert~1 (solid box); the dashed experts and their integration constitute the planned continuation of the work.}}{5}{figure.caption.21}%
